#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:101 85d0a73bcd05407999cf6751cc9e196e
msgid ""
"By default, stderr of client and server is logged to respective ``/var/log/"
"qubes/qrexec.XID`` files, in each of the VM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:103 2e8cfdd6cc1e403b92ff49d0ede7efcd
msgid ""
"Be very careful when coding and adding a new RPC service! Any vulnerability "
"in a RPC server can be fatal to security of the target VM!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/services/qrexec2.rst:105 8fb99dc6ac0e40649d04dae62f4e749e
